id: GUIDE2-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: hint_select
target: crates/core/src/hint_select.rs
find:         Some(uid) => hints_at(ir, uid, run.guidance_level),
replace:         Some(uid) => hints_at(ir, uid, GuidanceLevel::A),
expect-fail: the_list_changes_with_the_level
note: 現在の案内レベルを無視して常に水準 A の一覧を返す
